.jpg"},{"id":139096,"name":"Vladas Bagdonas","role":"Yan","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/58chkP7aSp51iKDjEtP295ZWl6k.jpg"},{"id":2034849,"name":"Irene Muscara","role":"Mariya","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sH3xQhDMfMln2jHhbM45GMh55gx.jpg"},{"id":1300371,"name":"Linda Nigmatulina","role":"Leyla"},{"id":1096523,"name":"Aleksey Kolubkov","role":"Valentin","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iRsYz42qWl3sHxhgxnrA1jK1cuz.jpg"},{"id":1605732,"name":"Petr Skvortsov","role":"Khaime","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qiBPm2IzvKRWAW6duE62TBLy9zh.jpg"},{"id":79824,"name":"Walter Grímsson","role":"Kannibal"},{"id":2034853,"name":"Davíð Freyr Þórunnarson","role":"Kannibal"},{"id":2034856,"name":"Sasha Frank","role":"Leytenant"},{"id":2034857,"name":"Paul Everson","role":"prison guard"},{"id":2034858,"name":"Úlfar Jakobsen","role":"prison guard"},{"id":1289776,"name":"Sergey Chikhachyov","role":"Yust Van Borg (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ufZN2epFB0XxRWliChtxMuhEChb.jpg"},{"id":1803729,"name":"Anna Popova","role":"Anna","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dKYFIrk9H9LeagKh6lAbmXbBZp8.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Titanium","overview":"Dieci detenuti, condannati a vivere per il resto delle loro vite sul Pianeta degli Esuli, tentano di attraversare un deserto senza vita in cerca delle mitiche Isole Felici, dove, si dice, nulla di male può capitare; sull’'sistenza delle Isole Felici, però, girano solo delle voci. I dieci si dividono in due gruppi: uno segue Erwin Kahn, l'altro Just van Borg. Entrambi i leader cercano di guidare gli altri lungo la stessa via impervia e pericolosa. La strada verso le Isole è disseminata di ostacoli, ma il premio finale sono la libertà e la felicità. Sempre che esistano..."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Calculator","overview":"Ten prisoners condemned to exile on a hostile planet XT-59 must pave the way through swamp to reach the Islands of Happiness, the only safe area on the planet, before the harsh climate or the underground horrors kill them all."},{"language":"ru-RU","title":"Вычислитель","overview":"Десять заключенных, приговоренных к пожизненному изгнанию с планеты XT-59, отправляются в опасный путь через Саргассово Болото. Группа сразу делится на две части: Эрвин и Кристи идут на поиск Счастливых Островов, Юст ведет остальных к Гнилой Мели. Однако долгое время их маршруты практически совпадают. В первый же вечер Эрвин понимает, что его должны убить — в прошлой жизни он занимал слишком высокий пост, и теперь он опасен для тех, кто пришел к власти. Выбрав в попутчицы Кристи, он сразу старается уйти подальше от остальных членов группы, чтобы обезопасить себя. На пути к Счастливым островам герои преодолевают массу препятствий. Цена этому — свобода и счастье.","tagline":"«Он знает, что будет»"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5XJOJqYQDKfg0LTFJ8noGLKCh59.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/Al1THat6GRVFQGdN3N7DUDphajm.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":316269,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"ru-RU","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/h7PAPCeHkGUEiFVHcos3clNG6OR.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/h7PAPCeHkGUEiFVHcos3clNG6OR.jpg","language":"en","width":1080,"height":1620},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/h7PAPCeHkGUEiFVHcos3clNG6OR.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/h7PAPCeHkGUEiFVHcos3clNG6OR.jpg","language":"en","width":1080,"height":1620}]},"ru":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5XJOJqYQDKfg0LTFJ8noGLKCh59.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb